# starsh2.dsk: the loader's state right after its BDOS $27 RDBLK into a DTA at $4000 (page 1 = RAM 3-0).
# A breakpoint at the loader's return address $C05B; registers, slot state and the first RAM bytes at $4000.
## before D-P1RDBLK
ref   10.814 AFTER_RDBLK PC=C05B AF=0142 A8=FC SUB=00 mem4000=f3ed7b4afc3100d6
zb    3.767 AFTER_RDBLK PC=C05B AF=0144 A8=FC SUB=00 mem4000=ffffffffffffffff
## after D-P1RDBLK
zb    3.852 AFTER_RDBLK PC=C05B AF=0144 A8=FC SUB=00 mem4000=f3ed7b4afc3100d6
